return ['domain'=>'zinn-cache','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'so_SO','project-id-version'=>'zinn-cache','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-09-30T00:04:55+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-09-30T00:04:55+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Cache'=>'Zinn® Cache','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-cache'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-cache','A page cache and a Redis object cache for any WordPress site. Uses the LiteSpeed server cache where there is one and its own disk cache everywhere else, purges only what a change affects, and proves its Redis connection works.'=>'Kaydka bogagga iyo kaydka shayga Redis ee kasta oo WordPress ah. Waxay isticmaashaa kaydka server-ka LiteSpeed halka uu jiro iyo kaydka disk-ka ee iyada u gaar ah meel kasta oo kale, waxay nadiifisaa kaliya waxa isbeddelku saameeyo, waxayna caddaynaysaa in xiriirkeeda Redis uu shaqeynayo.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Cache'=>'Kaydka','Page cache'=>'Bogga kaydka meelgaarka ah','Object cache'=>'Kaydka shayga','Purging'=>'Tiroobista','Exclusions'=>'Ka reeban','Purge everything now'=>'Nadiifi wax kasta hadda','Every cached page is discarded and will be rebuilt as visitors arrive. Continue?'=>'Bog kasta oo keydsan (cached) waa la tirtiray waxaana dib loo dhisi doonaa marka ay soo booqdayaashu yimaadaan. Ma rabtaa inaad sii waddo?','Full-page cache'=>'Kaydka bogga buuxa','On a LiteSpeed server, pages are served by the web server before WordPress runs. On any other server, this plugin stores each page as a file and serves it before WordPress loads. This is where nearly all the speed comes from.'=>'Server-ka LiteSpeed, bogisyada waxaa adeega shabakadda server-ka ka hor inta uusan WordPress shaqayn. Server kasta oo kale, sabuutaddan (plugin) waxay keydis personalidad kasta oo bog ah oo waxay u adeegtaa ka hor inta uusan WordPress soo bixin. Halkaan ayaa laga helaa ku dhawaad ​​dhammaan xawaaraha.','Cache pages for visitors who are not signed in'=>'Kaydi bogosyada booqdayayaasha aan soo gelin','How long a page stays cached'=>'Inta uu boggu kaydsan yahay','Seconds. A week suits most sites; a news site publishing hourly wants far less.'=>'Ilbidhiqsi. Todobaad ayaa ku habboon inta badan mareegaha; bogga wararka ee daabaca saacad kasta wuxuu rabaa wax aad uga yar.','How long a visitor’s browser keeps images and scripts'=>'Inta ay le\'eg tahay inta uu biraawsarka booqashadu hayo sawirrada iyo qoraallada kombuyuutarka','Seconds. Applies to images, CSS and JavaScript only — never to pages. Set to 0 to leave this to your host.'=>'Ilbiriqsiyo. Waxay khusaysaa kaliya sawirrada, CSS-ka iyo JavaScript-ka — weligeed ma khusayso bogagga. U deji 0 si aad tan ugu dayfto martigeliyahaaga.','Signed-in visitors'=>'Booqdayeyaasha soo galay','Never serve a cached page to a signed-in visitor'=>'Weligea ha u adeegin bogag kaydsan booqde soo galay','On is the safe answer and the default. Turn it off only if you know every cached page is identical for every signed-in user — a membership site is the usual reason not to.'=>'Daaridu waa jawaabta badbaadada leh waana tan caadiga ah. Demi kaliya haddii aad ogtahay in bog kasta oo la kaydiyay uu u siman yahay isticmaale kasta oo soo galay — bogga xubinnimada ayaa ah sababta caadiga ah ee aan loo damin.','Different lifetimes for different content'=>'Nolosho kala duwan ee xogta kala duwan','For example: a shop’s product pages for an hour, while everything else stays a week.'=>'Tusaale ahaan: bogagga badeecada ee dukaanka muddo saacad ah, iyadoo wax kasta oo kale ay sii jiraan hal toddobaad.','Add a rule'=>'Ku dar sharci','Content type'=>'Nooca nuxurka','Seconds'=>'Ilbiriqsiyo','Object cache (Redis)'=>'Kaydka walxaha (Redis)','Your host runs a private Redis object cache for this site and keeps it configured. There is nothing to set up here; the status at the top of this screen shows whether it is working.'=>'Host-kaagu waxa uu boggan u wadaa keyd shay Redis ah oo gaar ah oona wuu sii habeeyey. Halkaan wax lagu habeeyo ma jiraan; heerka ku yaal dusha shaashaddan waxa uu tusayaa in uu shaqeynayo iyo in kale.','Caches the results of database queries. It helps most on a busy shop or a site with a lot of signed-in traffic, where the page cache cannot.'=>'Wuxuu kaydiyaa natiijooyinka su\'aalaha database-ka. Waxay siweyn uga caawisaa dukaanka mashquulka badan ama bogga leh taraafiko badan oo soo galay, halkaas oo kaydka boggu (page cache) awoodin inuu sameeyo.','Install the Redis object-cache drop-in'=>'Ku rakib Redis object-cache drop-in','Needs the phpredis extension. If it is missing, the box above this screen says so.'=>'Waxay u baahan tahay kordhinta phpredis. Haddii ay ka maqan tahay, sanduuqa ka sarreeya shaashaddan ayaa sidaas sheegaya.','Redis host'=>'Martida Redis','Redis port'=>'Boortiga Redis','Redis database'=>'Xogtaanka Redis','Give each site on a shared Redis its own number, or they will clear each other’s cache.'=>'Go site kasta oo ku yaalla Redis wadareed lambarkiisa gaarka ah, ama midba midka kale ka tirtiri doono kaydkiisa (cache).','Redis username'=>'Magaca isticmaalaha Redis','Only for a Redis server with ACL users (Redis 6 or later). Leave blank to sign in with the password alone.'=>'Kaliya server-ka Redis ee leh isticmaaleyaasha ACL (Redis 6 ama wixii ka dambeeya). Iskadaa bannaan si aad ugu gasho erayga sirta ah oo keliya.','Redis password'=>'Erayga sirta ah ee Redis','Leave blank if your Redis does not need one.'=>'Haddii Redis uusan u baahnayn, meesha ka bannee.','Key prefix'=>'Furaha hordhaca','An alternative to a separate database number when you cannot have one.'=>'Beddelka lambarka database-ka ee gooni ah marka aadan yeelan karin.','Smart auto-purge'=>'Nadiifin caqli badan oo toos ah','Clear affected pages automatically when content changes'=>'Si toos ah u nadiifi bogagga ay dhibaatadu saameysey marka nuxurku isbeddelo','After updates'=>'Ka dib cusboonaysiinta','Clear everything after a core, plugin or theme update'=>'Tirtir wax kasta oo ka dambeeya cusboonaysiinta asaasiga ah, qalabka ama mawduuca','After a comment'=>'Ka dib faallo','Clear a post’s page when a comment on it is approved'=>'Nadiifi bogga qoraalka marka faallo ku taal la oggolaado','Turn this off on a very busy comment section, where it can clear the same page hundreds of times an hour.'=>'Dami tan qayb faallooyin ah oo aad u mashquul badan, halkaas oo ay ku nadiifin karto boggaas oo kale boqolaal jeer saacaddii.','Never cache these'=>'Weligi ha kaydin kuwani','Sensible WordPress and WooCommerce defaults are always applied — cart, checkout, my-account and any signed-in session are never cached, whatever is below.'=>'Heerarka caadiga ah ee macquulka ah ee WordPress iyo WooCommerce ayaa had iyo jeer la adeegsadaa — gaariga iibsashada, bixinta lacagta, akoonkayga iyo kalfadhi kasta oo la galay weligood lama kaydiyo, wax kasta oo hooseeya.','Addresses'=>'Ciwaannada IP-ga','One path per line, for example <code>/basket</code>. A trailing <code>*</code> matches everything under it.'=>'Hal dariiq ah sadarkiiiba, tusaale ahaan <code>/basket</code>. <code>*</code> dhammaadka ku taal waxay waafaqaysaa wax kasta oo hoos yaalla.','Query parameters'=>'Cabashooyinka weydiinta','A page carrying one of these is never cached — for example a one-time preview token.'=>'Bog ay ku jirto mid ka mid ah kuwan lagama kaydiyo — tusaale ahaan calaamada horu-eegista ee hal mar la isticmaalo.','Cookies'=>'Buskud','A visitor carrying one of these is always served a fresh page.'=>'Booqde sidan wata waxaa mar walba loo adeegaa bog cusub.','Every cached page has been discarded. They will be rebuilt as visitors arrive.'=>'Bog kasta oo kaydsan waa la tirtiray. Waxaa dib loo dhisi doonaa marka ay soo booqdayaal yimaadaan.','The object cache is installed, but it is not storing anything.'=>'Kaydka shayga waa la rakibay, laakiin wax xog ah ma kaydinayo.','The page cache is on, but pages are not being stored yet.'=>'Kaydka bogaggu wuu shaqeeyaa, laakiin bogaggu weli lama kaydinayo.','WordPress has not loaded the page-cache drop-in yet. It starts on the next page load; if it does not, check that WP_CACHE is true in wp-config.php.'=>'WordPress weli ma aanu shuban kaydka bogga ee hoos u dhaca (page-cache drop-in). Waxay ka bilaabmaysaa xamuulka bogga xiga; haddii aysan sameyn, hubi in WP_CACHE ay tahay run (true) gudaha wp-config.php.','The object cache is on, but this server has no Redis support.'=>'Kaydka shaygu waa daaran yahay, laakiin adeegetani ma taageerto Redis.','The phpredis extension is not installed, so the drop-in cannot be used and WordPress is falling back to its own in-memory cache. Ask your host to enable phpredis.'=>'Kordhiyaha phpredis lama rakibin, markaa lama isticmaali karo qalabka loo yaqaan drop-in, WordPress-na waxay ku noqonaysaa kaydkeeda xusuusta dhexdeeda ah. Weydii shirkaddaada martigelinta inay awood u yeelato phpredis.','Nothing is being cached.'=>'Wax khasnad ah lama keydinayo.','Both caches are switched off, so this plugin is not making the site any faster.'=>'Labada kayd (cache) waa la damiyay, markaa furahaani (plugin) ma keenayo in boggu si dhakhso ah u shaqeeyo.','Caching is active on this site.'=>'Kaydinta ayaa ka shaqeyneysa boggan.','Redis refused the username or password. Check the Redis credentials in wp-config.php or on this screen.'=>'Redis wuxuu diiday magaca isticmaalaha ama erayga sirta ah. Hubi aqoonsiga Redis ee ku jira wp-config.php ama shaashaddan.','Redis accepted the login but does not allow this site to store its keys. The Redis user needs permission for this site\'s key prefix.'=>'Redis wuu aqbalay gelitaanka laakiin uma oggolaanayo boggan inuu kaydiyo fureyaasheeda. Isticmaalaha Redis wuxuu u baahan yahay ogolaansho hordhaca furaha boggan.','Redis refused the database number. Check the Redis database setting.'=>'Redis wuu diiday nambarka xog-ururinta. Hubi dejinta xog-ururinta Redis.','Redis is out of memory and is refusing new data.'=>'Redis xusuusta ayay ka dhammaatay waxayna diidmaysaa xogta cusub.','The phpredis extension is not installed, so WordPress is using its own in-memory cache. Ask your host to enable phpredis.'=>'Kordhiyaha phpredis lama rakibin, markaa WordPress waxay isticmaashaa kaydkeeda xusuusta dhexdeeda ah. Weydii martigeliyahaaga inuu sahqo phpredis.','WP_REDIS_DISABLED is set in wp-config.php, so the object cache is switched off.'=>'WP_REDIS_DISABLED waxaa lagu dejiyay wp-config.php, markaa kaydka shayga waa la damiyay.','The Redis server could not be reached. Check the Redis host and port, and that Redis is running.'=>'Lama gaari karo server-ka Redis. Hubi host-ka iyo dekedda Redis, iyo in Redis uu shaqaynayo.','Redis did not return the value that was just written to it. Check the Redis server\'s logs.'=>'Redis ma soo celinin qiimihii hadda lagu qoray. Ka eeg diiwaannada server-ka Redis.','Web server'=>'Web server','LiteSpeed — pages are cached by the web server'=>'LiteSpeed — boggagu waxaa kaydiya server-ka mareegta','not LiteSpeed — pages are cached on disk by this plugin'=>'LiteSpeed ​​ma aha — boggag waxaa ku kaydiya saxan plugin-kan','Pages stored on disk'=>'Bogagga ku kaydsan saxanka','Redis support'=>'Taageerada Redis','phpredis is installed'=>'phpredis waa la rakibay','phpredis is not installed'=>'phpredis lama rakibin','Page lifetime'=>'Muddada nolosha bogga','You are not allowed to purge the cache.'=>'Uma oggola inaad nadiifiso kaydka.','Cache purge requested.'=>'Nadiifinta kaydka ayaa la codsaday.','Zinn® Cache: another object-cache drop-in is installed, so the Redis object cache is not managed by this plugin.'=>'Zinn® Cache: shayga kaydinta shayga kale waa la rakibay, markaa Redis kaydinta shayga looma maamulo plugin-kan.','detected'=>'la ogaaday','not detected'=>'lama ogaan','phpredis extension missing'=>'eextenshanka phpredis ayaa maqan','installed, not storing anything'=>'la rakibay, waxba ma kaydinayo','active, managed by your host'=>'shaqaynaya, waxa maamula martigeliyahaaga','active'=>'firfircoon','inactive'=>'aan firfircoonayn','LiteSpeed cache:'=>'Kaydka LiteSpeed:','Redis object cache:'=>'Kaydka walxaha Redis:','The Redis PHP extension (phpredis) is not available on this server, so the object cache cannot be enabled.'=>'Eextenshanka Redis PHP (phpredis) kuma jiro server-kan, sidaas darteed kaydka walxaha lama shidi karo.','Another object-cache drop-in is already installed. Remove it before enabling the Zinn® object cache.'=>'Drop-in-ka object-cache kale ayaa horay loo sii rakibay. Ka saar kahor intaadan awood-siin Zinn® object cache.','Could not write the Redis connection configuration file.'=>'Faylka habaynta xiriirka Redis lama qori karin.','The bundled object-cache drop-in could not be read.'=>'Drop-in-ka kaydka walxaha ee la keydiyay lama akhrin karin.','Could not install the object-cache drop-in into wp-content.'=>'Drop-in-ka kaydka walxaha laguma rakibi karin wp-content.','Could not remove the object-cache drop-in.'=>'Drop-in-ka kaydka walxaha lama saari karin.','The WordPress filesystem is not writable, so the object-cache drop-in could not be managed.'=>'Nidaamka faylalka WordPress lama qori karo, sidaas darteed drop-in-ka kaydka walxaha lama maareyn karin.','Another page-cache plugin has installed wp-content/advanced-cache.php. Remove that plugin first, or keep using its page cache.'=>'Qalab kale oo kaydinta bogagga (page-cache) ayaa rakibay wp-content/advanced-cache.php. Ka saar qalabkaas marka hore, ama sii wad isticmaalka kaydkiisa bogga.','The folder wp-content/cache/zinn-cache could not be written, so pages cannot be cached.'=>'Galka wp-content/cache/zinn-cache lama qori karo, markaas lama kaydin karo bogagga.','wp-content/advanced-cache.php could not be written, so pages cannot be cached.'=>'wp-content/advanced-cache.php lama qori karo, markaa bogagga lama kaydin karo.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Fiiri qoraallada sii-daynta ee Zinn Digital®.','The Zinn® update service did not issue a download link for this update. Check that this site can reach the Zinn® platform, then try again.'=>'Adeegga cusboonaysiinta ee Zinn® ayaan soo saarin xiriiriye soo dejineed oo loogu talagalay cusboonaysiintan. Hubi in boggani uu gaari karo madal-weyneha Zinn®, kadibna isku day mar labaad.','The update could not be downloaded from the Zinn® update service (%s). Try again in a few minutes.'=>'Cusboonaysiin-lahaanshaha lagama soo dejisan karo adeegga cusboonaysiin ee Zinn® (%s). Isku day mar kale daqiiqado yar gudahood.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Cusboonaysiinta la soo dejiyay waxay ku guuldareysatay hubinta dhammaystirnaanteeda, lamana rakibin.','Go Pro'=>'U gudub Pro','A cache analytics screen: hit ratio, memory, keys and the slowest cache commands.'=>'Shaashadda falanqaynta kaydka ku-meel-gaarka ah: saamiga ku dhaca, xusuusta, furayaasha iyo amarrada kaydka ee ugu gaabis badan.','A slow-query and uncached-call finder that names the plugin or theme responsible.'=>'Awoonee-weydiimaha gaabis ah iyo wicitaanada aan la kaydin ee magacaabaya qalabka ama mawduuca mas\'uulka ka ah.','An in-memory APCu tier in front of Redis for the hottest keys, plus prefetching, compression and the igbinary serializer.'=>'Tier APCu ah oo xusuusta dhexdeeda ah oo ka horreeya Redis furayaasha ugu kulul, iyo sidoo kale prefetching, cadaadis (compression) iyo igbinary serializer.','Tag-based purging for posts, terms and WooCommerce products, so only what changed is cleared, with the page and object caches purged together.'=>'Nadiifinta sumaddan ku saleysan ee qoraallada, shuruudaha iyo alaabta WooCommerce, si kaliya waxa is beddelay loo tirtiro, iyadoo cache-ka bogga iyo walxaha la isla nadiifiyo.','Automatic cache warm-up after a purge, WebP and AVIF images, unused-CSS removal and delayed JavaScript.'=>'Diirinta keshiga otoomatiga ah ka dib nadiifinta, sawirada WebP iyo AVIF, ka saarida CSS-ka aan la isticmaalin iyo JavaScript-ka dib loo dhigay.','Scheduled database clean-up with a preview, and per-page cache rules.'=>'Nadaqeynta keydka xogta ee la qorsheeyay oo wadata horudhac, iyo xeerarka kaydka ee bogagga ah.','Cache health alerts in your Zinn Digital® dashboard when the hit ratio drops or memory fills.'=>'Digniinaha caafimaadka kaydka ku meelgaarka ah ee looxaaga Zinn Digital® marka heerka shaqadu hoos u dhaco ama xusuustu buuxsamto.','Everything on the other tabs is free and stays free. Pro installs on top of this plugin and adds:'=>'Wax kasta oo ku jira tabisyada kale waa lacag la\'aan oo sidaa bay ku ahaaneysaa. Pro wuxuu ku rakibayaa kor ku xusan plugin-kan wuxuuna ku darayaa:','See what Pro costs'=>'Arag waxa uu Pro ku kacayo','Every plan starts with a 14-day free trial, no card needed: %1$s a year for one site, %2$s for five sites, %3$s for unlimited sites.'=>'Qorshe kasta wuxuu ka bilaabmayaa 14 maalmood oo tijaabo ah oo lacag la\'aan ah, kaarka deynta looma baahna: %1$s sannadkii hal degel, %2$s shan degel, %3$s degellada aan xadka lahayn.','wp-config.php was not found, so WP_CACHE could not be turned on. Add define( \'WP_CACHE\', true ); to it.'=>'Lama helin wp-config.php, markaa WP_CACHE lama shidi karin. Ku dar define( \'WP_CACHE\', true );.','wp-config.php already defines WP_CACHE as false, so the page cache cannot start. Change it to true.'=>'wp-config.php waxay horey u qeexday WP_CACHE inuu yahay false, markaa kaydka boggu ma bilaaban karo. U beddel true.','wp-config.php is not writable, so WP_CACHE could not be turned on. Add define( \'WP_CACHE\', true ); to it.'=>'wp-config.php lama qori karo, markaas WP_CACHE lama shidi karo. Ku dar define( \'WP_CACHE\', true ); meeshaas.','Stored. Type a new value to replace it.'=>'Waa la keydiyey. Geli qiime cusub si aad ugu beddesho.','Filter this list…'=>'Sifee liiskan…','Filter this list'=>'Sifee liiskan','Nothing matches that filter.'=>'Wax a waafaqsan miirahaas ma jiraan.','Add a row'=>'Ku dar saf','Remove this row'=>'Ka saar safkan','Remove'=>'Ka saar','Zinn Digital®'=>'Zinn Digital®','Zinn Digital® — overview'=>'Zinn Digital® — dulmar','Overview'=>'Guud mar','Copied'=>'La guuriyay','Every Zinn® plugin on this site, and whether it is working.'=>'Plug認証 kasta oo Zinn® ah oo ku yaalla boggan, iyo inuu shaqeynayo iyo inkale.','No connection is needed for this plugin.'=>'Looma baahna xiriir kor u qaadahan (plugin) kan.','Open settings'=>'Fur dejinta','You do not have permission to change these settings.'=>'Ma haystabis ogolaansho aad ku beddesho dejimahan.','Settings sections'=>'Qaybaha dejinta','Support'=>'Taageero','Save changes'=>'Kaydi isbeddellada','Tools'=>'Qalabka','Export settings'=>'Dhoofinta habaynta','Reset to defaults'=>'Dib ugu deji sida caadiga ah','This puts every setting on this plugin back to its default. Continue?'=>'Tani waxay ku celinaysaa dhammaan habaynta plugin-kan sidii ay asal ahaan ahaan jirtay. Ma rabtaa inaad sii waddo?','Diagnostics for support'=>'Cilad-baarista taageerada','Import a settings file'=>'Soo dejiso faylka dejinta','Import'=>'Keenso','Exported files never contain passwords, tokens or API keys — you will need to enter those again on the new site.'=>'Faylasha la dhoofiyay waligood kuma jiraan erayada sirta ah, calaamadaha ama furayaasha API - waa inaad kuwan dib u gelisaa bogga cusub.','Settings saved.'=>'Dejinta waa la keydiyay.','Every setting on this plugin is back to its default.'=>'Dejinta kasta oo ku taal qalabkan (plugin) waxay ku noqotay sidii loogu talagalay asalka ahaan.','Done.'=>'La dhammeeyay.','That action is not available.'=>'Falalkaas lama heli karo.','That file could not be read. Choose a settings file exported from a Zinn® plugin.'=>'Faylkaas lama akhrisan karo. Dooro faylka dejinta ee laga soo dhoofiyay Zinn® plugin.','That file is too large to be a settings export.'=>'Feylkaasi waa mid aad u weyn oo aan noqon karin dhoofinta dejinta.','That file is not a Zinn® settings export.'=>'Faylkani ma aha dhoofinta dejinta Zinn®.','That file was exported from a different plugin (%s), so importing it here would store settings this plugin does not understand.'=>'Feylkaas waxaa laga soo dhoofiyay qalab kale (%s), markaa halkan lagu soo dhoofiyo waxay kaydinaysaa dejinta aanu qalabkani fahmin.','%d setting imported. Passwords and API keys are never in an export, so enter those again.'=>'%d goobtii waa la soo dhoofiyay. Furayaasha sirta ah iyo furayaasha API-ga laguma daro dhoofinta, markaa fadlan mar kale gali kuwaas.' . "\0" . '%d goobaha la dhoofiyay. Furayaasha sirta ah iyo furayaasha API-ga laguma daro dhoofinta, markaa fadlan mar labaad geli kuwaas.','Connected'=>'Xiran','Connecting…'=>'Waa la xiriirinayaa…','Connected, but something needs attention'=>'Ku xidhan, laakiin wax baa u baahan in laga shaqeeyo','Not connected'=>'Lama xiriirin','Running on your own account'=>'Ka shaqaynaya akoonkaaga','We could not check this'=>'Kama aan soo kaban karin tan','This plugin did not say why. Send a diagnostics report and we will look.'=>'Qalabkan dheerada ahi ma uusan sheegin sababta. Dir warbixinta ogaanshaha waxaanan eegeynaa.','Connection status'=>'Xaaladda xiriirka','Last checked %s ago.'=>'Markii ugu dambeysay waxaa la hubiyay %s ka hor.','(opens in a new tab)'=>'(wuxuu ku furmayaa tab cusub)','Send this to Zinn® support'=>'U dir tan taageerada Zinn®','This is exactly what will be sent — nothing else, and nothing hidden. Your passwords, tokens and API keys are not in it.'=>'Tani waa sida saxda ah ee loo diri doono — wax kale ma jiraan, waxna ma qarsana. Furayaashaada sirta ah, calaamadaha aqoonsiga (tokens) iyo furayaasha API kuma jiraan.','The diagnostics report that will be sent'=>'Warbixinta ogaanshaha cilladaha ee la diri doono','Copy to clipboard'=>'Ku koobi sabuuradda','Send this report to Zinn® support'=>'Warbixintan u dir taageerada Zinn®','We open a support ticket for you and reply by email. If you would rather not send it, copy it above and paste it into a ticket yourself.'=>'Waxaan kuu fureynaa tikidh taageero ah waxaana kuugu soo jawaabeynaa iimayl. Haddii aadan jeclayn inaad dirto, kor ka soo guuri oo adigu iska geli tikidh.','We could not reach Zinn Digital® from this server (%s). Copy the report above and open a ticket instead — nothing about your settings is wrong.'=>'Lama gaari karin Zinn Digital® server-kan (%s) laga bilaabo. Nuqul ka yeero warbixinta kor ku xusan oo fur tikidh beddelkeeda — wax khalad ah kama jiraan dejintaada.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report and will reply by email.'=>'Taageerada Zinn® waxay heshay warbixintaada waxaana ay kuugu soo jawaabi doonaan iimayl.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report — reference %s — and will reply by email.'=>'Taageerada Zinn® waxay haysataa warbixintaada — tixraaca %s — waxayna kuugu soo jawaabi doontaa iimayl ahaan.','You have sent several reports in a short time. Wait a few minutes and try again — the earlier ones did arrive.'=>'Waxaad dirtay warbixino dhowr ah waqti gaaban gudahood. Sug daqiiqado yar kadibna mar kale isku day — kuwii hore way yimaadeen.','Zinn Digital® could not accept the report just now — that is our end, not yours. Try again shortly, or copy the report above into a ticket.'=>'Zinn Digital® ma awoorin in ay aqbasho warbixinta hadda — taasi waa dhinankeenna, ee maaha kanaga. Dib u day mar dhow, ama koobiyee warbixinta kore oo geli tigidh.','The report was refused (HTTP %d). Copy it above and open a ticket, quoting that number.'=>'Warbixinta waa la diiday (HTTP %d). Koobi garso kore oo fur tigidh, adigoo xiganaya lambarkaas.','Hosting customer? Get %1$d%% off %2$s'=>'Macaamiisha martigelinta? Hel %1$d%% dhimis %2$s','As a Zinn Digital® hosting customer you get a personal code for %d%% off your first payment. Renewals are at the normal price.'=>'Macmiil ahaan ee martigelinta Zinn Digital®, waxaad heleysaa kood shaqsiyeed oo ah %d%% dhimis ah lacagtaada ugu horreysa. Cusboonaysiinta waxaa lagu bixiyaa qiimaha caadiga ah.','Get my %d%% code and go to checkout'=>'Helo %d%% koodkayga oo tag bixinta','Sorry, you are not allowed to do that.'=>'Waan ka xumahay, looma oggola inaad taas samayso.','This discount is for customers with a paid hosting plan in good standing. Free trials do not qualify.'=>'Sicir-dhimisetan waxaa loogu talagalay macaamiisha haysta qorshe martigelin lacag ah oo xaaladdiisu wanaagsan tahay. Tijaabooyinka bilaashka ah uma qalmaan.','You have already used your hosting-customer discount for this plugin.'=>'Waxaad horay u isticmaashay qiimo dhimistaada macaamiisha martigelinta (hosting) ee plugin-kan.','We could not get your code just now. Please try again in a few minutes.'=>'Waanu heli wenay koodkaaga hadda. Fadlan isku day mar kale daqiiqado kooban kadib.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — hagayaasha iyo adeegyada','User guides'=>'Hagayaasha isticmaalaha','Read the %s user guide'=>'Akhri %s hagaha isticmaalaha','Hide this'=>'Qari tan','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Hosingka Zinn® ee WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, keymoimidaha maalinlaha ah, haajiridda bilaashka ah iyo guddiga kontoroolka ee loogu talagalay dadka wada in ka badan hal goob.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Suuqa Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Iibso oo iibi mareegaha, domaynada iyo meelaha xiriirinta la dhisay, iyadoo lacagta si ammaan ah loo hayo ilaa labada dhinac ay ka qanacayaan.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — kireyso dadkan u shaqaysta xirfad ahaan','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Suuqa kala iibsiga ee caalamiga ah: ka baadh in ka badan 10,000 adeeg oo diyaar ah oo ka yimid qoraayaasha, naqshadeeyayaasha, horumariyayaasha iyo khuburada SEO, ama soo dhig mashruuc oo u oggolow inay dalabkooda soo gudbiyaan.','Style preset'=>'Habka qaabka','A starting point. Anything below overrides it.'=>'Bilaabashada. Wixii ka hooseeya ayaa ka sarreeya.','Use my own colours and sizes'=>'Isticmaal midabadayda iyo cabbiradayda','Leave this off and the preset is used exactly as it is.'=>'Kani xirow oo hore-u-dejinta si sax ah ayaa loo isticmaali doonaa sida ay tahay.','Part of the message telling the user what they should receive via email.a license key'=>'furaha ruqsadda','A user has not yet been associated with the license, which is necessary to prevent unauthorized activation. To assign the license to your user, you agree to share your WordPress user\'s full name and email address.'=>'Isticmaale weli lama xiriirin shatiga, taas oo lagama maarmaan u ah in laga hortago hawlgelinta aan la oggolayn. Si aad shatiga ugu abuurto isticmaalahaaga, waxaad ogolaatay inaad wadaagto magaca buuxa ee isticmaalahaaga WordPress iyo cinwaanka iimaylka.','the above-mentioned sites'=>'goobaha la soo sheegay','Account'=>'Koontada','Account Details'=>'Tafaasiisha Koontada','Account is pending activation. Please check your email and click the link to activate your account and then submit the affiliate form again.'=>'Koontadu waxay sugeysaa in la hawlgeliyo. Fadlan hubi iimaylkaaga oo guji xiriiriyaha si aad u hawlgeliso koontadaada ka dibna mar kale soo gudbi foomka wakiilka.','Would you like to merge %1$s into %2$s?'=>'Ma rabtaa inaad ku darto %1$s gudaha %2$s?','Actions'=>'Tallaabooyinka','Activate'=>'Hawl geli','Activate Free Version'=>'Aawinta Nooc Bilaash Ah','Activate License'=>'Firida Shatiga','activate a license here'=>'hawlgeli ruqsad halkan','Please enter the license key that you received in the email right after the purchase:'=>'Fadlan geli furaha shatiga ee aad ku heshay iimaylka isla markiiba ka dib iibsashada:','Activate license on all sites in the network.'=>'Shati ka yeeli dhammaan goobaha shabakadda ku jira.','Activate license on all pending sites.'=>'Dhaqaaji shatiga dhammaan mareegaha sugaya.',' The paid version of %1$s is already installed. Please activate it to start benefiting from the %2$s features. %3$s'=>'Nooca lacagta ah ee %1$s waa horay loo rakibay. Fadlan hawlgeli si aad u bilowdo ka faa\'iidaysiga astaamaha %2$s. %3$s',' The paid version of %1$s is already installed. Please navigate to the %2$s to activate it and start benefiting from the %3$s features.'=>'Nooca lacagta ah ee %1$s waa horay loo rakibay. Fadlan u gudub %2$s si aad u bilowdo oo aad uga faa\'iidaysato sifooyinka %3$s.','Activate this add-on'=>'Fududee ku-lammaanahan','Activate %s'=>'Kici %s','Activate %s features'=>'Hawlgalinta sifooyinka %s','%s - plugin name. As complete "PluginX" activation nowComplete "%s" Activation Now'=>'Hadda Dhammaystir Hawlgelinta "%s"','Activate %s Plan'=>'Dhaqaaji Qorshaha %s','Activated'=>'La hawl-galiyey','Activating'=>'Firigaya','Activating license'=>'Shatiyada waa la hawlgelinayaa','Your account was successfully activated with the %s plan.'=>'Koontadaada waxaa lagu guuleystay in lagu hawlgeliyo qorshaha %s.','active add-onActive'=>'Shaqaynaya','Add another domain'=>'Ku dar domain kale','Add-Ons'=>'Ku-dar-yaalka','Add Ons for %s'=>'Tilmaamaha %s','We couldn\'t load the add-ons list. It\'s probably an issue on our side, please try to come back in few minutes.'=>'Waan awoodi weynnay inaan soo rarno liiska agabka dheeraadka ah. Waxaa laga yaabaa inay arrintu ka timid dhinaceenna, fadlan isku day inaad soo noqoto daqiiqado gudahood.','Add-On'=>'Ku dar','%s is a premium only add-on. You have to purchase a license first before activating the plugin.'=>'%s waa wax-ku-kordhin lacag ah oo keliya. Waa inaad marka hore iibsataa shati ka hor inta aanad hawlgelinin furaha barnaamijka.','%s Add-on was successfully purchased.'=>'%s Ku-darkinta waxaa si guul leh loo iibsaday.','Your %s Add-on plan was successfully upgraded.'=>'Qorshahaaga %s Add-on si guul leh ayaa loo casriyeeyay.','%s free trial was successfully cancelled. Since the add-on is premium only it was automatically deactivated. If you like to use it in the future, you\'ll have to purchase a license.'=>'%s ee tijaabada bilaashka ah waa la joojiyay. Maadaama ku-darista ay tahay mid qiimo leh oo kaliya, si toos ah ayaa loo demiyay. Haddii aad jeclaan lahayd inaad isticmaasho mustaqbalka, waa inaad iibsataa ruqsad.','addonX cannot run...%s cannot run without the plugin.'=>'%s ma shaqeyn karo plug-in-ka la\'aanteed.','addonX cannot run without pluginY%1$s cannot run without %2$s.'=>'%1$s ma shaqeyn karo la\'aanteed %2$s.','Just letting you know that the add-ons information of %s is being pulled from an external server.'=>'Kaliya waxaan ku ogeysiinayaa in xogta dheeriga ah ee %s laga soo jiidayo server dibadeed.','Add Ons of module %s'=>'Ku-darista module %s','Address'=>'Cinwaanka','Address Line %d'=>'Cinwaanka %d','Affiliate'=>'Wakiilka','Due to violation of our affiliation terms, we decided to temporarily block your affiliation account. If you have any questions, please contact support.'=>'Sababtoo ah xadgudubka shuruudaha xiriirinta, waxaan go\'aansanay inaan si ku-meel-gaar ah u xirno akoonkaaga xiriirinta. Haddii aad qabtid wax su\'aalo ah, fadlan la xiriir taageerada.','Your affiliation account was temporarily suspended.'=>'Koontadaada xiriirka waxaa la joojiyay si KMG ah.','Your affiliate application for %1$s has been accepted! Log in to your affiliate area at: %2$s.'=>'Codsigaaga wada-shaqeynta ee %1$s waa la aqbalay! Soo gal aaggaaga wada-shaqeynta adoo isticmaalaya: %2$s.','Thank you for applying for our affiliate program, unfortunately, we\'ve decided at this point to reject your application. Please try again in 30 days.'=>'Waan ku mahadcelineynaa codsigaaga ku aaddan barnaamijka shuraakada, nasiib darro, waxaan go\'aansannnay inaan diidno codsigaaga wakhtigan. Fadlan isku day mar labaad 30 maalmood ka dib.','Thank you for applying for our affiliate program, we\'ll review your details during the next 14 days and will get back to you with further information.'=>'Waad ku mahadsan tahay inaad soo codsatay barnaamijkayaga xiriirinta, waxaan haysan doonaa xogtaada 14-ka maalmood ee soo socota waxaanana kuugu soo jawaabi doonaa macluumaad dheeraad ah.','%s tracking cookie after the first visit to maximize earnings potential.'=>'%s raadraaca buskutiyada ka dib booqashada ugu horreysa si loo kordhiyo dakhliga suurtagalka ah.','Affiliation'=>'Xubinimada','Once your license expires you can still use the Free version but you will NOT have access to the %s features.'=>'Markabkagu dhaco, wali waad isticmaali kartaa nooca Bilaashka ah laakiin MA heli doontid sifooyinka %s.','Once your license expires you will no longer be able to use the %s, unless you activate it again with a valid premium license.'=>'Marka ay shatigaagu dhacdo, ma awoodi doontid inaad sii isticmaashid %s, illaa aad dib uga hawlgeliso shati lacag-bixin ah oo sax ah.','You can still enjoy all %1$s features but you will not have access to %2$s security & feature updates, nor support.'=>'Weli waad ku raaxaysan kartaa dhammaan sifooyinka %1$s laakiin ma heli doontid amniga iyo cusboonaysiinta sifooyinka ee %2$s, mana heli doontid taageero.','Thanks for upgrading.'=>'Waad ku mahadsan tahay kor u qaadista.','After your free %1$s, pay as little as %2$s'=>'Ka dib %1$s-kaaga bilaashka ah, bixi wax aan badnayn %2$s','Agree & Activate License'=>'Oggolow & Fududee Shatiga','I Agree - Change User'=>'Waan Ku Heshiiyay - Beddel Isticmaalaha','All Requests'=>'Dhammaan Codsiyada','All Types'=>'Noocyada oo dhan','allow'=>'ogolow','You\'ve already opted-in to our usage-tracking, which helps us keep improving the %s.'=>'Horay baad ugu biirtay raadraaca isticmaalkayaga, taasoo naga caawisa inaan sii wadano horumarinta %s.','You\'ve already opted-in to our usage-tracking, which helps us keep improving them.'=>'Waxaad horay uga qayb qaadatay la socodka isticmaalkayaga, taas oo naga caawisa inaan sii wadano horumarintooda.','Amount'=>'Cadadka','as once a yearAnnual'=>'Sanadkii','as once a yearAnnually'=>'Sanad kasta','Anonymous feedback'=>'Jawaab-celinta qarsoodiga ah','as application program interfaceAPI'=>'API','Apply on all sites in the network.'=>'Ku dabool dhammaan mareegaha shabakadda.','Apply on all pending sites.'=>'Ku dabool dhammaan mareegaha sugaya.','Apply to become an affiliate'=>'Codsos si aad u noqotid xubin ku-xigeen','Approve & Start Trial'=>'Anqari & Bilow Tijaabada','Kindly tell us the reason so we can improve.'=>'Fadlan noogu sheeg sababta si aan u horumarino.','Enter the email address you\'ve used for the upgrade below and we will resend you the license key.'=>'Geli ciwaanka iimaylka ee aad u isticmaashay casriyeynta hoos waxaanuna dib kuu soo diri doonaa furaha shatiga.','Enter the email address you\'ve used during the purchase and we will resend you the license key.'=>'Geli cinwaanka iimeylka ee aad isticmaashay intii lagu guda jiray iibsashada waxaanuna dib kuu soo diri doonaa furaha shatiga.','Associate with the license owner\'s account.'=>'La xiriir koontada mulkiilaha liisanka.','as the plugin authorAuthor'=>'Qoraa','Invalid module ID.'=>'Aqoonsiga qaybtu waa mid aan ⁠sax ahayn.','You do not have a valid license to access the premium version.'=>'Ma haytid shati sax ah oo aad ku gasho nooca qaaliga ah.','Auto installation only works for opted-in users.'=>'Ku-rakibidda otomaatiga ah waxay u shaqeysaa oo keliya isticmaaleyaasha is-diiwaangeliyey.','Premium version already active.'=>'Nooca qaaliga ah ayaa mar hore hawlgelin ah.','Premium add-on version already installed.'=>'Nooca lagu daray ee qaaliga ah ayaa horay loo rakibay.','Plugin is a "Serviceware" which means it does not have a premium code version.'=>'Plugin waa "Serviceware", taas oo la macno ah inuusan lahayn nooc code ah oo lacag ah.','Automatic Installation'=>'Ku-shubidda Tooska ah','timer for auto-disabling debugAuto off in:'=>'Demi si toban ah:','Average Rating'=>'Ugu Raytingka Dhexeysa