aanka dhammaan sifooyinka qiimaha leh. Ma hubtaa?','Cancel %s & Proceed'=>'Jooji %s & Sii wad','Cancelled'=>'La joojiyay','Cancelling the subscription'=>'Joojinaya rukumashada','Can\'t find your license key?'=>'Ma heli kartid furahaaga shatiga?','Change License'=>'Beddel Shatiga','A confirmation email was just sent to %s. You must confirm the update within the next 4 hours. If you cannot find the email, please check your spam folder.'=>'Email xaqiijin ah ayaa hadda loo diray %s. Waa inaad xaqiijisaa cusboonaysiinta 4-ta saacadood ee soo socota. Haddii aadan heli karin email-ka, fadlan hubi galkaaga spam-ka.','A confirmation email was just sent to %s. The email owner must confirm the update within the next 4 hours.'=>'Farriin xaqiijin ah ayaa hadda loo diray %s. Mulkiilaha iimaylku waa inuu xaqiijiyo cusboonaysiinta 4-ta saacadood ee soo socota gudahooda.','%s is the new owner of the account.'=>'%s waa milkiilaha cusub ee koontada.','Thanks for confirming the ownership change. An email was just sent to %s for final approval.'=>'Mahadsan sanad in aad xaqiijisay beddelka lahaanshaha. Iimayl ayaa hadda loo diray %s si loo ansixiyo ugu dambeeya.','Change Ownership'=>'Beddel Mulkiilaha','Change Plan'=>'Beddel Qorshaha','Change User'=>'Beddel Isticmaalaha','By changing the user, you agree to transfer the account ownership to:'=>'Adigoo bedelaya isticmaalaha, waxaad ogolaanaysaa inaad u wareejiso la-wareegidda koontada:','Plugin installer section titleChangelog'=>'Taariikhda wax-ka-beddelka','Changing user, please wait'=>'Isticmaalaha waa la beddelayaa, fadlan sug','If you didn\'t get the email, try checking your spam folder or search for emails from %4$s.'=>'Haddii aadan helin iimaylka, isku day inaad hubiso galkaaga spam-ka ama ka raadi iimaylleyda ka yimid %4$s.','Checkout'=>'Lacag bixinta','Choose up to %s site(s) to activate the license on.'=>'Dooro ilaa %s goob(bo) si aad shatiga ugu shaqeyso.','City'=>'Magaalo','Clear API Cache'=>'Nadiifi Kaydka API','Clear Updates Transients'=>'Nadiifi Cusboonaysiisyada Ku-meel-gaarka ah','Part of an activation link message.Click here'=>'Halkan riix','Click here to use the plugin anonymously'=>'Halkan guji si aad plugin-ka u isticmaasho adigoo anaan looga aqoon','Click to see reviews that provided a rating of %s'=>'Guji si aad u aragto faallooyinka bixiyay qiimeynta %s','%s is my client\'s email address'=>'%s waa cinwaanka iimaylka ee macmiilkayga','Code'=>'Koodh','%s commission when a customer purchases a new license.'=>'%s oo ah guddiyo marka macmiilku iibsado ruqsad cusub.','As we reserve 30 days for potential refunds, we only pay commissions that are older than 30 days.'=>'Maaddaama aanu 30 maalmood u kaydinayno suurtagalnimada dib-u-bixinta, waxaan bixin karnaa oo keliya komishannada ka weyn 30 maalmood.','Communication'=>'Isgaarsiinta','Compatible up to'=>'La jaanqaadi kara ilaa','complete the opt-in'=>'dhameystir isdiiwaangelinta','as congratulationsCongrats'=>'Hambalyo','Never miss an important update'=>'Weligi ha seegin wararka cusub ee muhiimka ah','Thank you for updating to %1$s v%2$s!'=>'Mahadsan sanid in aad u cusbooneysiisay %1$s v%2$s!','Opt in to get email notifications for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers, and to share some basic WordPress environment info. This will help us make the %s more compatible with your site and better at doing what you need it to.'=>'Iska diwaangeli si aad u hesho ogeysiisyada iimeelka ee ku saabsan amniga & cusboonaysiinta sifooyinka, waxyaabaha waxbarashada, iyo dalabyada marmarka qaarkood, iyo inaad la wadaagto xoogaa xog ah oo aasaasi ah oo ku saabsan jawiga WordPress. Tani waxay naga caawin doontaa inaan %s ka dhigno mid ku habboon boggaaga oo ka sii wanaagsan qabashada waxa aad uga baahan tahay.','Opt in to get email notifications for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers, and to share some basic WordPress environment info.'=>'Ku biir si aad u hesho ogeysiisyo iimayl oo ku saabsan cusboonaysiinta amniga iyo astaamaha, waxyaabo waxbarasho, iyo dalabyo mararka qaar, oo aad la wadaagto macluumaad guud oo ku saabsan deegaanka WordPress.','If you skip this, that\'s okay! %1$s will still work just fine.'=>'Haddii aad ka gudubto arrintan, waa caadi! %1$s weli si fiican ayuu u shaqayn doonaa.','We have introduced this opt-in so you never miss an important update and help us make the %s more compatible with your site and better at doing what you need it to.'=>'Waxaan soo bandhignay ikhtiyaarkan si aadan weligaba u seegin cusboonaysiin muhiim ah oo naga caawiso inaan ka dhigno %s mid si fiican ula jaanqaadaysa boggaaga isla markaana si wanaagsan u qabata waxa aad uga baahan tahay.','We\'re excited to introduce the Freemius network-level integration.'=>'Waan ku faraxsanahay inaan soo bandhigno is-dhexgalka heerka shabakadda ee Freemius.','During the update process we detected %s site(s) in the network that are still pending your attention.'=>'Intii lagu guda jiray habka cusboonaysiinta waxaan ka helnay shabakadaha %s ee ku jira shabakada kuwaas oo weli u baahan dareenkaaga.','During the update process we detected %d site(s) that are still pending license activation.'=>'Inta lagu jiro habka cusboonaysiinta, waxaanu ogaanay %d goob(bo) oo weli sugaysa in shatiga la hawlgeliyo.','If you\'d like to use the %s on those sites, please enter your license key below and click the activation button.'=>'Haddii aad jeclaan lahayd inaad isticmaasho %s ee ku yaal bogaggaas, fadlan gelifurahaaga sharciga hoos oo guji badhanka hawlgelinta.','Alternatively, you can skip it for now and activate the license later, in your %s\'s network-level Account page.'=>'Haddii kale, waad ka boodi kartaa hadda oo aad shatiga hawlgelin kartaa dib, bogga Akoonka heerka shabakadda ee %sda.','as connection was successfulConnected'=>'Xiran','Once you are done, deactivate the %s and activate it again.'=>'Markaad dhamaysato, dami %s oo dib u daari.','Contact'=>'La xiriir','Please let us know if you\'d like us to contact you for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers:'=>'Fadlan nagu soo wargeli haddii aad jeclaan lahayd inaynu kula soo xiriirno wixii ku saabsan cusboonaysiinta amniga & sifooyinka, waxyaabaha waxbarashada, iyo dalabyada marmarka qaarkood:','Contact Support'=>'La xiriir Taageerada','Sorry for the inconvenience and we are here to help if you give us a chance.'=>'Waan ka xumahay dhibaatada soo gaartay, waana joognaa si aan ku caawino haddii aad na siiso fursad.','Contact Us'=>'Nala Xiriir','Please contact us here'=>'Fadlan nagala soo xiriir halkan','Please contact us with the following message:'=>'Fadlan nagala soo xiriir fariintan soo socota:','Continue'=>'Sii wad','Contributors'=>'Ka qaybqaatayaasha','Couldn\'t activate %s.'=>'Lama hawlgelin karo %s.','Country'=>'Waddanka','Cron Type'=>'Nooca Cron','We use PHP cURL library for the API calls, which is a very common library and usually installed and activated out of the box. Unfortunately, cURL is not activated (or disabled) on your server.'=>'Waxaan u adeegsannaa maktabadda PHP cURL wicitaanada API, taas oo ah maktabad aad u caan ah oo badanaa lagu rakibo laguna shaqaysiiyo si toos ah. Nasiib darro, cURL lama shaqaysiin (ama waa la damiyay) server-kaaga.','data'=>'xogta','Debug mode was successfully enabled and will be automatically disabled in 60 min. You can also disable it earlier by clicking the "Stop Debug" link.'=>'Habka khalid-saaridda (Debug mode) si guul leh ayaa loo daartay waxaana si otomaatig ah loo damin doonaa 60 daqiiqo gudahood. Waxaad sidoo kale damin kartaa horay adigoo gujinaya xiriiriyaha "Stop Debug".','Date'=>'Taariikh','Deactivate'=>'Jooji','Deactivate the free version'=>'Demakii nooca bilaashka ah','Deactivate License'=>'Dami Shatiga','Deactivating your license will block all premium features, but will enable activating the license on another site. Are you sure you want to proceed?'=>'Demarkaynta rukhsaddaadu waxay xidhi doontaa dhammaan sifooyinka qaaliga ah, laakiin waxay sahlaysaa in rukhsadda laga hawlgeliyo goob kale. Ma hubtaa inaad rabto inaad sii waddo?','Deactivation'=>'Joojin','Yes - %s'=>'Haa - %s','Submit & %s'=>'Gudbi & %s','Deactivating or uninstalling the %s will automatically disable the license, which you\'ll be able to use on another site.'=>'%s in dejinta ama ka saaridda waxay si toos ah u joojinaysaa shatiga, kaas oo aad ku isticmaali kartid bog kale.','If you have a moment, please let us know why you are %s'=>'Haddii aad waqti haysato, fadlan noo soo sheeg sababta aad u tahay %s','Debug Log'=>'Diiwaanka Cilmi-baarista','as code debuggingDebugging'=>'Cillad-bixinta','delegate'=>'Wakiilsho','If you click it, this decision will be delegated to the sites administrators.'=>'Haddii aad gujiso, go\'aankan waxaa loo xilsaari doonaa maamulayaasha mareegaha.','Delegate to Site Admins'=>'Ku wareeji Maamuleyaasha Site-ka','Delegate to Site Admins & Continue'=>'U wakiil Maamulayaasha Goobta & Sii wad','Delegating, please wait'=>'Waa la wakiilayaa, fadlan sug','verbDelete'=>'Tirtir','Delete All Accounts'=>'Tirtir dhammaan Akoonnada','Are you sure you want to delete all Freemius data?'=>'Ma hubtaa inaad rabto inaad tirtirto dhammaan xogta Freemius?','Plugin installer section titleDescription'=>'Sharaxaad','Details'=>'Faahfaahin','seems like the key you entered doesn\'t match our records.'=>'waxaa u muuqata in furaha aad gelisay uusan waafaqsanayn diiwaankeena.','Diagnostic Info'=>'Xogta Baaritaanka','Disabling white-label mode'=>'Naafaynta habka calaamadda-cad','Disconnect'=>'Ka jar','Are you sure you would like to proceed with the disconnection?'=>'Ma hubtaa inaad rabto inaad sii waddo goynta?','If you wish to cancel your %1$s plan\'s subscription instead, please navigate to the %2$s and cancel it there.'=>'Haddii aad halkaas beddelkeeda rabto inaad joojiso rukunka qorshahaaga %1$s, fadlan u gudub %2$s oo halkaas kaga jooji.','as close a windowDismiss'=>'Iska dhaaf','do %1$sNOT%2$s send me security & feature updates, educational content and offers.'=>'ha u dirin %1$sNOT%2$s cusbooneysiinta amniga iyo astaamaha, nuxurka waxbarashada iyo dalabyada.','Enter the domain of your website or other websites from where you plan to promote the %s.'=>'Geli magaca domain-ka mareegahaaga ama mareegaha kale ee aad qorsheyneyso inaad ka soo xayeysiiso %s.','Where are you going to promote the %s?'=>'Halkee baad ku Talajirtaa inaad ku xayeysiiso %s?','Domain is required.'=>'Degmada waa khasab.','Donate to this plugin'=>'Ku deeq plugin-kan','Done'=>'La dhammeeyey','Don\'t cancel %s - I\'m still interested in getting security & feature updates, as well as be able to contact support.'=>'Ha joojin %s -Wali waxaan xiiseynayaa helitaanka amniga & casriyeynta muuqaalka, iyo sidoo kale inaan awood u yeesho inaan la xiriiro taageerada.','Don\'t have a license key?'=>'Ma haysatid furaha liisanka?','You might have missed it, but you don\'t have to share any data and can just %s the opt-in.'=>'Waxaa laga yaabaa inaad ka tagtay, laakiin khasab kuma aha inaad wadaagto xog kasta oo waxaad si fudud u %s kartaa ikhtiyaarka is-diiwaangelinta.','verbDowngrade'=>'Hoos u dhig','%1$s will immediately stop all future recurring payments and your %2$s plan license will expire in %3$s.'=>'%1$s waxay si degdeg ah u joojin doontaa dhammaan lacag-bixinta soo noqnoqda ee mustaqbalka, shatigaaga qorshaha %2$s wuxuu dhici doonaa %3$s gudahood.','Downgrading'=>'Hoos u dhigista','Downgrading your plan'=>'Qorshahaaga hoos u dhigaya','Download'=>'Soo deji','as download latest versionDownload Latest'=>'So Degso Kan Ugu Dambeeyay','as download latest versionDownload Latest Free Version'=>'So Degso Nooca Lacag La\'aanta ah ee Ugu Dambeeya','Download the latest version'=>'Soo deji nuqulkii ugu dambeeyay','Download the latest %s version'=>'Soo deji nooca ugu dambeeya ee %s','Download Paid Version'=>'Soo deji Nooca Lacagta ah','Download %s Version'=>'Soo deji Nooca %s','Downloaded'=>'La soo 