ahood. Haddii aad jeceshahay inaad gacanta ku sameyso - guji badhanka joojinta hadda.','The installation process has started and may take a few minutes to complete. Please wait until it is done - do not refresh this page.'=>'Habka rakibiddu wuu billowday waxaana laga yaabaa inay qaadato dhowr daqiiqadood in la dhammeeyo. Fadlan sug ilaa inta ay ka dhammaanayso - ha cusboonaysiin boggan.','Installing plugin: %s'=>'Rakibayaa darajada: %s','Invalid clone resolution action.'=>'Tallaabada xallinta nuqul-sameynta ee khaldan.','Invalid domain'=>'Domain aan sax ahayn','Invalid new user ID or email address.'=>'Aqoonsiga isticmaalaha cusub ama ciwaanka iimaylka waa khalad.','Invalid site details collection.'=>'Ururinta tafaasiisha mareegaha waa mid aan ansax ahayn.','Invoice'=>'Qaansheeg','Is Active'=>'Wuu Shaqaynayaa','Keep Sharing'=>'Sii wad wadaagista','Key'=>'Furaha','Last'=>'Ugu dambeyn','Last license'=>'Sharciga u dambeeya','Last Updated'=>'Ugu Dambeysay ee La Cusboonaysiiyay','Latest Free Version Installed'=>'Nooca Ugu Dambeeya ee Lacag La\'aanta ah ee La Rakibay','Latest Version Installed'=>'Nooca ugu Dambeeya ee La Rakibay','the latest %s version here'=>'noocyadii ugu dambeeyay ee %s halkan','Learn more'=>'Wax badan baro','Length'=>'Dhererka','Your license was successfully activated.'=>'Shatiinkaaga si guul leh ayaa loo hawlgeliyay.','It looks like the license could not be activated.'=>'Waxaa u muuqata in shatigu aanu shaqeyn karin.','%s to activate the license once you get it.'=>'%s si aad u hawlgeliso shatiga marka aad hesho.','License Agreement'=>'Heshiiska Sharciga ah','Your license has been cancelled. If you think it\'s a mistake, please contact support.'=>'Satshirankaaga waa la joojiyay. Haddii aad u malaynayso inay tahay qalad, fadlan la xidhiidh taageerada.','It looks like the license deactivation failed.'=>'Waxaa u muuqata in dib-u-kicinta shatigu ay guuldarreysatay.','Your license was successfully deactivated, you are back to the %s plan.'=>'Saddex-gacmeedk