 baahnayn, markaa waxaan si weyn ugu talineynaa in aad haysato ogolaanshaha lagama maarmaanka ah.','Cancel %1$s - I no longer need any security & feature updates, nor support for %2$s because I\'m not planning to use the %3$s on this, or any other site.'=>'Jooji %1$s - Uma baahni mar dambe wax cusboonaysiin ah oo ku saabsan amniga & astaamaha, mana u baahni taageero ku aaddan %2$s sababta oo ah ma qorshaynayo inaan isticmaalo %3$s kan, ama degel kale oo kasta.','Cancel %s?'=>'Ma joojisaa %s?','Cancelling %s'=>'Joojinaya %s','Cancelling %s...'=>'La joojinayaa %s...','Click here'=>'Halkan riix','Deactivating'=>'Deminaya','Disconnecting the website will permanently remove %s from your User Dashboard\'s account.'=>'Joojinta xiriirka shabakadda waxay si joogto ah uga saari doontaa %s koontadaada Dashboardka Isticmaalaha.','For automatic delivery of security & feature updates, and license management & protection, %s needs to:'=>'Si loo helo dhalinta tooska ah ee amniga & cusboonaysiinta sifooyinka, iyo maamulka & ilaalinta shatiga, %s waxay u baahan tahay in la:','For delivery of security & feature updates, and license management, %s needs to'=>'Si loo gaarsiiyo amniga & cusboonaysiinta sifooyinka, iyo maaraynta shatiga, %s waxay u baahan tahay inaanay','Freemius is our licensing and software updates engine'=>'Freemius waa shatigayaga iyo matoorayada cusboonaysiinta barnaamijka','If this is a long term duplicate, to keep automatic updates and paid functionality after %1$s, please %2$s.'=>'Haddii tani ay tahay nuqul muddo dheer ah, si aad u ilaaliso cusboonaysiinta tooska ah iyo shaqaynta lacagta lagu bixiyo %1$s ka dib, fadlan %2$s.','Is %2$s a duplicate of %4$s?'=>'Ma %2$s ma waa nuqul ka mid ah %4$s?','Join the Beta Program'=>'Ku biir Barnaamijka Beta-ha','Join the Beta program'=>'Ku biir barnaamijka Beta','License'=>'Sugoomi','License Key'=>'Furaha Shatiga','License key'=>'Furaha ruqhadda','Monthly'=>'Bishiiba','Names, slugs, versions, and if active or not'=>'Magacyada