ox at %2$s. Please make sure you click the button in that email to %3$s.'=>'Waxaad tahay in aad ka hesho iimayl xaqiijin ah %1$s sanduuqaaga iimaylka ee ku yaal %2$s. Fadlan hubi inaad gujiso badhanka ku jira iimaylkaas si aad %3$s.','days'=>'maalmaha','deactivating'=>'gabayaa','hour'=>'saacad','hours'=>'saacadood','license'=>'shati','optional'=>'ikhtiyaari ah','products'=>'Alaabooyinka','skip'=>'ka bood','subscription'=>'ruun-gelinta','trial'=>'tijaabo','Clone resolution admin notice products list labelProducts'=>'Alaabooyinka','as activating pluginActivating'=>'Waa la hawlgelinayaa','as software licenseLicense'=>'Sugoomi','close a windowDismiss'=>'Iska kaydso','close windowDismiss'=>'Ka tago','like websitesSites'=>'Goobaha','nounPricing'=>'Qiimaha','trial periodTrial'=>'Imtixaan','verbOpt In'=>'Ogolaado','verbOpt Out'=>'Ka bax','verbSkip'=>'Ka bood','verbUpgrade'=>'Cusbooneysii','x-ago%s ago'=>'%s ka hor']];